<https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/codes/nullflavor/MSK> skos:inScheme fhirr4:absentReasonCodes .
<https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/codes/nullflavor/NA> skos:inScheme fhirr4:absentReasonCodes .
<https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/codes/nullflavor/UNK> skos:inScheme fhirr4:absentReasonCodes .
<https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/codes/nullflavor/NINF> skos:inScheme fhirr4:absentReasonCodes .
<https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/codes/nullflavor/PINF> skos:inScheme fhirr4:absentReasonCodes .
<https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/codes/nullflavor/ASKU> skos:inScheme fhirr4:absentReasonCodes .
<https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/codes/nullflavor/NASK> skos:inScheme fhirr4:absentReasonCodes .
<https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/codes/nullflavor/NAVU> skos:inScheme fhirr4:absentReasonCodes .
